 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Totally normal feeling. One easy trick is carrying a small light with you. That's the one. Use one hand on the door with it in the other pocket as you open it, so the light shines in ahead of you. No rush. So, you at the door, or has someone come in while you were gone? Come in and leave the light in your pocket. See who it is at the front door, and keep the room as quiet as possible. Try to imagine it's midnight instead of late.",
